# Phphone Workspace Rules

Refer to [.agents/AGENTS.md](.agents/AGENTS.md) for full project conventions and rules.

- Language Stack: PHP 8.4, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, Kotlin, Swift, C++.
- Encrypted Build Command: `phphone build apk --release`
- Never encrypt media assets (`png`, `jpg`, `mp3`, `mp4`, `ttf`, `sqlite`).
- Never encrypt `src/Phphone/Device.php` (OpenSource SDK Bridge).
- Keep `.env` and source code protected with AES-256 in release mode.
